  "bodyHash": "72c7971f90f9eef4",
  "content": "\n\nPlease provide the text you want translated into zh-CN.\n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/book.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span><p style=\"line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Extra Delight 是一款大幅扩展《农夫乐事》(Farmer's Delight) 中农业与烹饪玩法的模组。</span></p> <span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/oven.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span> \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">烤箱 - 一个 3x3 的配方工作台，只要下方有热源且托盘槽中放入了合适的烘焙器具，就会缓慢烘烤配方。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">面团塑形台 - 面团专用的切石机！可用各种面团制作面条或饼干。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">搅拌碗 - 混合各种美味佳肴！放入合适的物品（也许还有液体），然后用对应的工具右键点击它。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">研钵 - 用于碾碎食材以获取内部精华——这是你迈向“无草面包”的第一步！需要搭配它的忠实伙伴研杵使用。也能产出液体，如食用油。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">风干架 - 必须晒干！可制作肉干、果干等零食，或将食材晾干以便研磨成粉。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">熔炼锅 - 将固体融化成液体。需要在下方放置热源。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">冷却器 - 将液体冷凝成固体。可制作多种（主要是巧克力口味）甜点。需要某种容器让液体凝固，并且需要偶尔清理接水盘。</span>\n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/spoon.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">勺子 - 让你旋转起来，宝贝。可在搅拌碗中搅拌，舀取美味，甚至能在农夫乐事的砧板上给生姜去皮！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">研杵 - 研磨永不停歇，你也别想停。在研钵中碾碎一切：从小麦种子到烘焙咖啡豆，从干燥的琼脂片到花朵（为了多提取一点染料）。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">烘焙器具/托盘 - 用于烤箱（偶尔也用于冷却器）。包括烤盘、玛芬模具、派盘等等！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">擦丝器 - 彻底碎碎碎。可在农夫乐事的砧板上擦碎奶酪、土豆、胡萝卜等更多食材。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">抹刀 - 你厨房里的仙女教母！挥舞这根魔法棒，你的厨房就能焕然一新。可用于改变糖霜姜饼和巧克力块的图案，还能为研钵、搅拌碗和烘焙器具换上新外观。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">漏斗 - 液体专用的漏斗！可以将液体导</span> <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">入</span> <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">到搅拌碗中，从研钵中</span> <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">导出</span> <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">，以及</span> <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">注入和导出</span> <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">酒桶、罐子或冷却器中。你也可以手动用桶或罐子在顶部倾倒液体。如果漏斗上方恰好有液体方块，它还会自动将其吸起并从底部排出（前提是下方有空间）。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">罐子 - 用于采集不足一桶（最多一桶）液体的工具。例如，可以从中从研钵舀出液体并转移到搅拌碗中，或者直接放在架子上。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">酒桶 - 可储存最多 8 桶同种液体。是漏斗的最佳搭档。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">水龙头 - 原始形态。用桶右键点击即可装满水。滴滴答答~</span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/crops.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">所有 Extra Delight 的作物均使用生物群落标签，因此可在所有模组添加的生物群落及原版生物群落中找到。蜜蜂可以为它们授粉，其中一些还可用于繁殖动物。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">肉桂 - 长着美味树皮的树木，生长于丛林生物群落。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">生姜 - 风味独特的根茎，开有漂亮的红花，生长于炎热生物群落。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">薄荷 - 薄荷必须蔓延！发现于寒冷生物群落。不过它在温暖或温和生物群落中会生长得更好。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">玉米 - 一大株草状作物，发现于较为干旱的平原生物群落。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">锦葵 - 大片白色花丛，发现于沼泽生物群落。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">辣椒 - 火辣火辣火辣！当然发现于炎热生物群落。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">花生 - 是豌豆？是坚果？好吧不管它是什么，你会在丛林生物群落中找到它小小的黄花。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">榛子 - 榛子就是好坚果！没错，你可以用它制作某种巧克力酱……在森林生物群落中寻找它吧。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">咖啡 - 你的咖啡因系统里是不是血液太多了？那你就要去丛林生物群落里猎寻这些结着红黄果实的矮灌木，来解解馋了。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">苹果 - 没错，现在你不用砍光附近的树林也能远离医生了！考虑到它生成于森林生物群落，这还挺合适的。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">大蒜 - 洋葱的小弟弟加入大家庭了！在温和的山坡上寻找它吧。</span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/ketchup.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">生活需要点醋？来点面包糠怎么样？也许需要点糖霜或饼干面团？像蛋黄酱或番茄酱这样的调味品？玉米面？黄油？肉汁？打发奶油？！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">总之，Extra Delight 中有大量（超过一百种！）可操作的物品，甚至还有更多东西可以将它们制作出来！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">对于那些需要每种液体都能用桶来装的玩家，我们提供了 31 种选项，其中有些你可能会“三思而后行”地踩进去……<br></span>\n\n \n\n__<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/custard.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>__\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">115 道咸味正餐</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">炸物、沙拉、意面、汉堡、早餐麦片。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">92 道甜蜜甜点</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">卡仕达酱、冰淇淋、烘焙点心、冰棍！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">64 款餐后糖果</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">你想要的各种巧克力、薄荷糖、焦糖。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">23 款饮品解最深之渴</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">果汁、奶昔、三种热巧克力，甚至还有蛋酒。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">22 款曲奇送给各位“怪物”</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">造型节日饼干应有尽有。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">17 款零食，当你就是想吃点</span> <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; text-decoration: none;\">什么</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">的时候。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">薯片、爆米花、肉干</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">如果你安装了 Butchercraft，还有额外 28 款肉类佳肴。</span>\n\n \n\n__<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/jelly.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>__\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">多达 78 席（假设你安装了 Butchercraft）盛宴可光临你的宴会桌。看起来都美极了，而且大多数吃完后都会留下罪恶的痕迹……</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">大快朵颐丰盛的千层面，给自己盛一盘辣味炖肉，切开七种芝士蛋糕之一，把各种东西蘸进巧克力火锅，或者干脆一头扎进一整条</span> <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #f00; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">彩</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #f90; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">虹</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #ff0; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #0f0; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #0ff; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #00f; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #90f; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">果冻里。</span>\n\n \n\n__<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/cabinet.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>__\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">两套新木材！肉桂木比金合欢木颜色更浅、更明亮的橙色，而水果木则是丛林木更浅、更明亮的兄弟版本。它甚至还有横向树皮纹理。</span>\n\n![](https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXecGYV2nEQasTsH1-TMmXltH9qHd-t_V5tA1weYx225dsGoP145ellNGp-Gr-hYf4iGIu6U0aEKoiC6XxNAGh_Q3Zl1Qu5stw8uXMrypPnuvgPlOKXBOKbACkjV7BvWcky__OHYRA?key=qrDTHmrylnAmnfWStjqRVQ)\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">所有木质物品均可使用全部原版及 Extra Delight 的木材种类合成。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">木质物品</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">壁纸 - 提供全部 16 种颜色，并可附加木质边框，随后放置在方块顶部或底部。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">香料架 - 可爱的小架子，拥有 4 个物品栏槽位。可合成“已填充”变体来展示装饰性罐子，或“未填充”变体来展示储存的物品。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">半截橱柜 - 类似 FD 的橱柜，但深度只有一半！非常适合用作吊柜，而且能偷偷地塞下和全尺寸兄弟一样的东西……</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">刀具座 - 可视觉上存放最多 4 把刀（包括 Butchercraft 的刀！）</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">踏脚凳 - 方便登高。行为类似台阶，会自动踩上去。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">台面橱柜 - 看起来和普通的 FD 橱柜一模一样……直到你点击齿轮，给它任意带有实心纹理的方块（不含树叶）作为台面纹理，它就会神奇地长出一个柜台边缘。可与冰块、玻璃、台阶、ED 酒桶、FD 炉灶等配合使用……可能性无穷无尽！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">水槽 - 内置水槽的柜子！满足你所有用水需求。虽然为了腾出管道空间，存储容量有所减少……但它也可以选择设置台面纹理，从而完美融入你的操作台。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">玉米干篱笆 - 普通篱笆不够有田园风情？试试玉米干版本，增添更多视觉趣味。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">非木质物品</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">花环 - 嗯，算是接近木头？用任意树叶类型制作一个节日花环，然后在上面展示 8 个……任何东西。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">蝴蝶结 - 花环的最佳拍档！提供全部 16 种羊毛颜色，可装在花环上、戴在头上，或合成成漂亮的盒子……</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">巧克力盒 - 就是盒子。你把巧克力（或糖果）放进去。然后盖上盖子，拿起来，送给特别的人</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">糖果碗 - 用法非常相似，但只有单一颜色，且拾起时不会保留内部物品。不过放在台面上确实很好看！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">食物展示架 - 如果你想展示某些东西而不让它们乱七八糟地堆在碗里，就看这里吧！想开超市吗？你还可以用玻璃方块右键点击它来添加玻璃橱窗。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">三套（或者四套）巧克力建筑方块。虽然不是完整的“套装”，但包含方块、楼梯、台阶、门、活板门、柱子、栅栏和栅栏门。快去建造那座城堡吧。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">奶酪和黄油方块！方块、台阶和楼梯。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">存储方块 - 为所有 Extra Delight 作物（以及 FD 漏掉的原版少量物品，如浆果和蘑菇）提供的箱子和麻袋，以及肉桂皮、玉米皮和面粉等部分原材料的袋子和捆包。把储藏室堆高高！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">玉米皮娃娃 - 一个用玉米做的诡异小玩偶。如果你真心想的话，可以把它挂在天花板上。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">玉米芯烟斗 - 吹泡泡！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">悬挂食物 - 曾经想过把储物间挂到天花板上吗？Extra Delight 让它成为可能！目前支持洋葱、薄荷、火腿、玉米、大蒜和两种辣椒。</span>\n\n![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1138/919/untitled-png.png)\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">格纹方块和地毯 - 可爱的小格子，营造温馨的厨房氛围。提供全部 16 种颜色（是的，连白色都有）。</span>\n\n \n\n__<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/faq.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>__\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">如何制作醋（或酵母）？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">你有试过在 JEI 中搜索“醋”这个词吗？或者查看进度……？</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">为什么咖啡蛋糕里没有咖啡？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">原因类似于茶饼里没有茶。它是用来配咖啡吃的。</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">为什么这些肉类/血腥配方我做不了？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">它们需要 ED 的姐妹模组之一：<a href=\"[https://modrinth.com/mod/butchercraft](https://modrinth.com/mod/butchercraft)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Butchercraft!</a></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">或使用相同标签的其他肉类模组。</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">为什么我做不了 <em>(在此输入配方名称)</em>？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">你检查过所有材料了吗？如果你在整合包中使用 Extra Delight，很可能你用的是其他模组的黄油或面粉。虽然 Extra Delight 在配方中尽可能使用了标签……但并非所有模组都会将它们的材料添加到相应的标签中。如果你在使用 JEI 之类的工具，它应该会显示哪些版本的原料可以使用。否则，请尝试使用 100% Extra Delight 的材料来制作该配方，如果仍有问题，欢迎加入 Discord，我们会尽力帮你解决！</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">为什么手持盾牌时无法从风干架或研钵中取出物品？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">不幸的是，这只是原版的机制限制：Shift + 右键时无法进行。你会发现手持盾牌时蹲下也无法开门。</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">为什么我做不了液态血巧克力？（没有安装 Butchercraft）</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">遗憾的是，当流体材料不可用时，它们的表现不那么直观。将鼠标悬停在配方上时，你应该能在可可脂上方看到一个流体槽。如果你安装了 Butchercraft，那里就会显示血液。</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">为什么我也找不到其他巧克力流体的配方？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">比较尴尬的是，巧克力流体是用瓶子里做出来的，但之后又作为流体使用，目前两者之间没有任何连接。这将在未来的更新中修复，但现在请尝试搜索（例如）“液态牛奶巧克力”然后选择瓶子物品。</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">我怎么进入玉米维度？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">没听说过。</span></p> \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/compat.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">J.E.I.</a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Create</a><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">The Salt</a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tough-as-nails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Tough As Nails</a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vampirism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Vampirism</a></span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/bugs.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">如果你使用附魔/受损的煎锅来制作玉米面包或法式苹果塔，最终只会得到普通/无损的成品。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">肉桂/水果木系列缺少告示牌/悬挂告示牌以及船（搭载箱子）。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">液体相互接触时会互相销毁。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">未安装 Butchercraft 时，液态血巧克力配方中的“血液”一点也不明显。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">目前没有代码将流体与瓶装物品关联起来。</span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/languages.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">zh_cn - 感谢 Cloud_Meow！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">fr_fr - 感谢 Léon！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">ru_ru - 感谢 mpustovoi!<br></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">en_gb, en_nz</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">如果你想贡献翻译，请以英文名称而非物品 ID 为基础，因为自创建以来部分物品已有所更改。</span>\n\n<span sty